quran[24]{c,v,t}:
  37,1,"By those (angels) ranged in ranks,"
  37,2,"by the ones who drive (the clouds) vigorously,*"
  37,3,(and) by the ones who recite the Reminder:*
  37,4,"surely, your God is One,"
  37,5,"the Lord of the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them, and the Lord of the easts."
  37,6,We have decorated the nearest heaven with the adornment of stars and planets.
  37,7,And (there is) protection (for them) from every rebellious devil.
  37,8,"They cannot listen to the Highest Assembly (of the angels), for they are repelled (through burning brands) from every side,"
  37,9,"being driven away, and there is an everlasting punishment for them."
  37,10,"But whoever (among the devils) tries to snatch a fragment (of information from the angels), a piercing flame pursues him."
  37,11,"So ask them: are they more difficult to create or those (other creatures) We have created (in the heavenly universe)? Surely, We have created them just from sticky clay."
  37,12,"Indeed, you wonder while they ridicule (your message)."
  37,13,"And (even) when they are reminded, they never become mindful."
  37,14,"And whenever they see a sign, they incite one another to ridicule."
  37,15,And say: ‘This is nothing but clear magic.
  37,16,"What! When we are dead and have become dust and bones, shall we then be resurrected?"
  37,17,And our forefathers as well?’
  37,18,Say: ‘Yes indeed! And you will (also) be humiliated.’
  37,19,"So, it will be only a single blast, and then they will look at once."
  37,20,"And they will say: ‘Oh, woe to us! It is the Day of Retribution.’"
  37,21,"(It will be said: ‘Yes!) It is the Day of Final Judgement, which you used to deny.’"
  37,22,"(Allah will command:) ‘Assemble all the wrongdoers with their counterparts and those (false gods) they used to worship,"
  37,23,"besides Allah, and show them the way to Hell."
  37,24,And stop them! For they shall be questioned.’
